        },
        "quote": "The purpose of this chapter is to create and maintain stream buffers as a best management practice. Stream buffers enhance water quality and provide a method of complying with the City’s national pollution elimination discharge permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "65dcc085-c565-5f32-9a0a-4a233cf7dc85",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 365,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:1",
          "start": 236
        },
        "quote": "(a) Buffers adjacent to waterways provide environmental protection and resource management benefits, which include the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "3eca046f-dd53-5075-8c69-778b530f3402",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 411,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:2",
          "start": 366
        },
        "quote": "(1) Helping protect the public from flooding;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "637460c7-2d56-58f6-b828-29d5fbece793",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 463,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:3",
          "start": 412
        },
        "quote": "(2) Controlling erosion and reducing sedimentation;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "4f111b44-ae38-50d5-a9ba-a90490b43b87",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 493,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:4",
          "start": 464
        },
        "quote": "(3) Stabilizing stream banks;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "7aff745d-c92a-5950-86c6-36bdba8c9cc1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 542,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:5",
          "start": 494
        },
        "quote": "(4) Removing pollutants delivered in stormwater;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "627e7ded-e185-5dd1-9c53-c9335a82e56c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 644,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:6",
          "start": 543
        },
        "quote": "(5) Restoring and maintaining the chemical, physical and biological integrity of the water resources;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "d7d16b6b-dd49-5deb-b245-7ee8b5e8e4f6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 693,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:7",
          "start": 645
        },
        "quote": "(6) Providing infiltration of stormwater runoff;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "3a5be78d-664b-50ba-a2b5-cf2a997490f2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 779,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:8",
          "start": 694
        },
        "quote": "(7) Providing tree canopy to shade streams and promoting desirable aquatic organisms;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "43a93d46-62f7-595a-8f11-f111447eef32",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 820,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:9",
          "start": 780
        },
        "quote": "(8) Providing riparian wildlife habitat;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "2999462a-3d9c-5dd2-b488-e3722257d412",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 878,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:10",
          "start": 821
        },
        "quote": "(9) Furnishing scenic value and recreational opportunity;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "60d12c96-53f7-59ac-bcd1-ea3ea477c42f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 928,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:11",
          "start": 879
        },
        "quote": "(10) Providing sustainable native vegetation; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "cfbfda3b-29cf-53cd-a16f-b9b32bd7af4f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 967,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:12",
          "start": 929
        },
        "quote": "(11) Maintaining base flow of streams.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "64ca3294-6bb1-5097-b9ac-bc6bef427ca8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1214,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:13",
          "start": 968
        },
        "quote": "It is the desire of the City to protect and maintain the native vegetation in riparian and wetland areas by implementing specifications for the establishment, protection and maintenance of buffer vegetation along waterways within the City limits.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 17.10.010 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "54b21d26-2198-56f9-b08b-d4b865c3606c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1652,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:14",
          "start": 1215
        },
        "quote": "(b) The intent of this chapter is to establish the minimum acceptable requirements for the design of buffers to protect the waterways of the City; to protect the water quality of waterways, reservoirs, lakes, and other significant water resources within the City; to protect the City’s riparian and aquatic ecosystems; and to provide for the environmentally sound use of the land resources. (Ord. 17837 § 1, 5-21-02. Code 1995 § 66-151.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.10.010:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
